---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base path="/terms" title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using Arnav's Portfolio, including third-party work and links.">
  <article class="plain">
    <h1>Using this site</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated 14 November 2026.</p>

    <h2>What this site is</h2>
    <p>A personal portfolio of Arnav Patnaik's work, research and experience, provided for general information only. Nothing here is professional, financial, insurance, environmental, medical or legal advice, and nothing here is an offer of services or a binding commitment. Please do not rely on it as the basis for any decision.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>I try to describe my work accurately, but I do not promise that everything on the site is complete, current or free of errors. Results on a project page are what the cited source reports and are not guarantees of outcomes elsewhere. Research listed here has co-authors; the linked conference pages are the authoritative record.</p>

    <h2>Content and ownership</h2>
    <p>The text and design of this site belong to Arnav Patnaik. Research, datasets, employers' materials, and third-party names, logos and certificates belong to their owners, who are not affiliated with or endorsing this site unless stated. You may link to any page. Please do not copy or republish content without permission.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services and links</h2>
    <p>The site links to or loads content from other services, such as Calendly, Microsoft Power BI, GitHub and LinkedIn. They are outside my control. Your use of them is governed by their own terms, and I am not responsible for their content, availability or practices.</p>

    <h2>Messages and enquiries</h2>
    <p>Sending me an email or booking a call does not create a professional, employment or client relationship. Please do not send confidential or sensitive information. I may not be able to reply to every message.</p>

    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>The site is provided as is and as available. It may change, be interrupted or be removed at any time without notice.</p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>To the fullest extent the law allows, I am not liable for any loss or damage arising from using this site, relying on its content, or using any linked or embedded third-party service. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>

    <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
    <p>I may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version. Using the site means you accept the current terms. They are governed by the laws of Belgium, unless mandatory consumer law where you live says otherwise.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
